<body>
    <h1>User-Service: Technical Documentation</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h3 local-id=3D"92bcb8b5-f448-4ab1-b96c-e2a22a379995" id=3D"User-Se=
rvice:TechnicalDocumentation-1.Overview">1. Overview</h3>
<p local-id=3D"d369cd5f-b857-4c8b-a0ba-31679b55a91b">The user-service is re=
sponsible for user profile management, user-organization relationships, use=
r metadata, and user file references. Authentication and role management ar=
e handled by dedicated services, so user-service focuses on user-centric da=
ta and business logic.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"375ba409-8575-47ac-ae90-07637b757a75" id=3D"User-Service:Te=
chnicalDocumentation-2.UserFlows">2. User Flows</h3>
<h4 local-id=3D"c33693b3-dcfc-4408-99b8-8f21c818e0dc" id=3D"User-Service:Te=
chnicalDocumentation-a.UserProfileManagement">a. User Profile Management</h=
4>
<ul local-id=3D"ab949ad7-64bd-41cd-934f-c8a05d2b16be">
<li local-id=3D"5d2602c9-49bc-4d44-aedf-ae4ada8241cd">
<p local-id=3D"b9d3a024-3e75-4550-9f95-31ab34160519"><strong>Create User</s=
trong>: Triggered by auth-service after successful signup.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b3e0e112-e97b-40e9-8d71-236707b8b058">
<p local-id=3D"6a432b2e-e305-423d-9f24-c0537a194f1f"><strong>Get User</stro=
ng>: Fetch user profile by userId.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9f2d6592-8268-49bc-acd0-b60c636c7f7f">
<p local-id=3D"f13dabf0-5689-44d3-8221-1b104e5534eb"><strong>Update User</s=
trong>: Update user profile fields (name, contact, etc.).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d3dc9e67-baaa-4008-bede-5d1fcc328194">
<p local-id=3D"cd037d72-a299-41b3-a1bd-843cfd475131"><strong>Delete User</s=
trong>: Remove user profile (soft or hard delete).</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"defaab68-b232-4641-857d-6969cebf1be4" id=3D"User-Service:Te=
chnicalDocumentation-b.User-OrganizationMapping">b. User-Organization Mappi=
ng</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"3a6f9ebb-d456-48e5-8192-c0b6fdadf393">
<li local-id=3D"c7b774b2-e289-4462-a466-37dcb54c27d0">
<p local-id=3D"217c5ae5-9812-42b0-a829-78738d25d177"><strong>Assign User to=
 Organization</strong>: Add mapping between user and organization.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2c90a6ef-3525-42ec-bcbf-9bdb4b00c29f">
<p local-id=3D"f723c758-9ef5-4901-85b8-267408d432bb"><strong>List User Orga=
nizations</strong>: Fetch all organizations a user belongs to.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"a0f6bd36-b589-4493-b2b0-291215577306" id=3D"User-Service:Te=
chnicalDocumentation-c.UserMetadata&amp;Files">c. User Metadata &amp; Files=
</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"a240a2be-29c7-4b98-8527-4444ce2b3347">
<li local-id=3D"f6a41ed6-0953-4afb-9801-802a8cc9c23b">
<p local-id=3D"0fa3de72-bb12-4818-aa6e-c3825c181d0e"><strong>Update Metadat=
a</strong>: Store or update custom user metadata.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4a579ebc-f621-4118-96c8-cc80913cd3d7">
<p local-id=3D"8134e52a-aea7-432a-9de2-d45e27ac307b"><strong>Upload File</s=
trong>: User uploads file to S3, Lambda updates user record with file refer=
ence.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1bbf5269-9836-4ba5-a3a6-df8278823bc5">
<p local-id=3D"9acbfa33-b64e-4b60-a92e-ac816ac5a149"><strong>List Files</st=
rong>: List all files associated with a user.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"3affcaf9-565c-4cf3-8c9f-5b07fe740d3a" id=3D"User-Service:Te=
chnicalDocumentation-d.Event-DrivenFlows">d. Event-Driven Flows</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"97ad6d2e-3132-4994-b06c-3f627ea27ac4">
<li local-id=3D"d2ca5334-e744-4d74-a89e-9905167e37f9">
<p local-id=3D"a9b93d60-3e89-49b7-947f-80033e5b60bb"><strong>Profile Change=
 Events</strong>: DynamoDB Streams trigger audit, analytics, or notificatio=
n Lambdas.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f02849a9-1928-4c4a-a8df-86f7f5f15627">
<p local-id=3D"a0c3089c-59fa-468d-b379-925217d12e10"><strong>Reminders/Noti=
fications</strong>: SQS triggers for user reminders.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"5293e2e6-0558-431a-b84f-94cd1d5303a3" id=3D"User-Service:Te=
chnicalDocumentation-3.AWSArchitectureDiagram">3. AWS Architecture Diagram<=
/h3><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper co=
nfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image imag=
e-center" alt=3D"image-20251217-095440.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" =
src=3D"5cc45d533fdadd3edcb16b038461bff7ef8964591ba34357963a528c82478bbd" da=
ta-image-src=3D"https://firminiq.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34=
