<ul local-id=3D"c4d45672-dfc5-424a-9c46-76c0935fcf14">
<li local-id=3D"b409ef6f-a231-40d4-aa9b-c0b32b03219e">
<p local-id=3D"a6214ed0-dc5d-4c3f-af91-742c17313679"><strong>API Gateway</s=
trong>: Entry point for all user-service APIs.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"40f3f472-9424-4205-8e20-1f83e11ec351">
<p local-id=3D"0b4e6170-3e4b-478e-b892-3f35d7f519a3"><strong>User-Service L=
ambdas</strong>: Handle business logic for user CRUD, mapping, metadata, an=
d file reference.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b09f2957-79d9-4647-8eb7-a63daf9d659f">
<p local-id=3D"6db69d55-ec85-4262-bf30-ac1e505f2038"><strong>DynamoDB UserT=
able</strong>: Stores all user data.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"26f55084-bcc5-4897-a918-f5ac95abec0c">
<p local-id=3D"707372ac-361d-4e15-ae44-7db08d3a355d"><strong>DynamoDB Strea=
ms</strong>: Triggers for audit, analytics, and notifications.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5a06c491-707c-4f3a-b6b0-3531a10f7b52">
<p local-id=3D"653b1997-7ae2-4517-b687-1b03f8d8bb93"><strong>S3</strong>: F=
or user file uploads.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"13608031-40ee-4eda-af93-f951daef1033">
<p local-id=3D"40b77bc4-21c4-4441-bddd-4c77bb3a353f"><strong>SQS</strong>: =
For async reminders/notifications.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"c58a2c99-6885-46e9-b868-7e49c15d33d7" id=3D"User-Service:Te=
chnicalDocumentation-4.DynamoDBTableDesign&amp;AccessPatterns">4. DynamoDB =
Table Design &amp; Access Patterns</h3>
